    "description": "Morning. The time of day when you can’t figure out how to get to your drive-thru coffee place because there’s new construction and the sun is super low, so you’re squinting at the signs, trying to figure out if you are supposed to turn left here or if you definitely should NOT turn left here, because you will get three tires shredded by sharp, metal chunks before you fall in a hole. \r\n\r\nThis piece of music is based on the old-timey concept of calm, beautiful, renewing mornings.",
